  "description": "OpenXML Markdown text providers for Dignite Vault Extract: PptxExtractor owns the full PPTX parsing pass (slide text + native alt-text + speaker notes + charts/tables), and DocxExtractor owns the full DOCX parsing pass (headings + flowing text + embedded images, with tables/lists/inline-formatting/charts landing across #308). Both extract embedded raster images and transcribe each through the host-selected IOcrProvider, inlining everything into the Markdown at its reading position. EMF/WMF vector images are an accepted blind spot.",
